than555/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ethan555/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T06:55:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T06:55:04Z","body":"I ran into this with custom tooltips using RichTextLabels with BBcode, where it seemed to calculate the required height of the container based on the custom minimum size of the RichTextLabel instead of the actual size it could expand into, with the discrepancy becoming more noticeable based on the amount of text. This was particularly bad when CustomMinimumSize.X was 0.\nThis was fixed for me by setting CustomMinimumSize for the RichTextLabel equal to the size of its parent container; although, it requires that the width of the container being constant isn't a problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3895235470/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5229024593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102096#issuecomment-5229024593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102096","id":5229024593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN6yVUQ","user":{"login":"Kylemcarthur","id":29736706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzM2NzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29736706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur","html_url":"https://github.com/Kylemcarthur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-09T00:40:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T00:40:04Z","body":"This seems to be the source of the bug that's been plaguing my custom tooltip system, which involves a TooltipsContainer (VBoxContainer) that get child Tooltips (PanelContainer + RichTextLabel child) instantiated into it. Under specific, seemingly random yet consistent conditions, the TooltipsContainer would grow so massive that the child Tooltips were no longer rendering on the screen at all, or at best, were heavily displaced from the intended position.\n\nHowever, following the advice above of setting CustomMinimumSize.X for RichtextLabel somewhat improved the problem (more was rendering on screen than before) but it was still displaced. I tried both setting the RichTextLabel custom minimum size to be equal to the Container and greater than the Container, and the bug was still present in some cases.\n\nThe band-aid that I just found to be producing the expected result is awaiting the next process_frame before updating the position. That fixed every instance of this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5229024593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]